{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261112%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E6%A1%88%E8%B8%8F%E5%85%A5%E5%AF%A9%E8%A8%8A%E7%AC%AC36%E5%A4%A9-%E9%A6%96%E8%A2%AB%E5%91%8A%E9%84%BA%E6%B8%AF%E5%82%91%E4%BD%9C%E4%BE%9B%E6%9C%9F%E9%96%93-%E5%85%AC%E7%9C%BE%E6%97%81%E8%81%BD%E5%B8%AD%E9%80%A3%E6%97%A5%E5%B9%BE%E8%BF%91%E5%9D%90%E6%BB%BF-%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E6%98%8E%E8%B5%B7%E5%AF%A6%E6%96%BD%E6%B4%BE%E7%B1%8C%E5%AE%89%E6%8E%92-819x1024.jpg\" width=\"819\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>蔡天鳳案今（12日）踏入第36天審訊，首被告、蔡天鳳前大伯鄺港傑第4天作供，旁聽人士眾多，高等法院6樓正庭及設電視直播的延伸庭連日幾近坐滿。法院職員今日下午開始在法院LG4樓層外區域，拉起紅白帶設立輪候區。據司法機構公告，案件明將實施特別座位安排，就明早10時的聆訊，職員8時起於LG4派發公眾席籌，公眾人士須以先到先得形式輪候取籌。<a href=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/?s=HCCC198%2F2025\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">【蔡天鳳案報道結集】</a></strong></p>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>高等法院就本案共設323個公眾席，首11人可進入6樓正庭，3樓、6樓及12樓的延伸庭則分別有112、88及112個公眾席。</p>\n<p>公眾席籌分為紫、綠、橙及藍色，保安會查籌，若持籌人士不進入或離開法庭15分鐘後，該籌就會失效，相關位置將被分配給他人。<strong><a href=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/?s=HCCC198%2F2025\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">【蔡天鳳案報道結集】</a></strong></p>\n<p>法院：高等法院<br/>法官：暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>被告：鄺港智、鄺港傑、鄺球<br/>控罪：謀殺、阻止合法埋葬屍體<br/><br/>法律代表：<br/>控方：外聘資深大律師Charlotte Draycott郭莎樂、高級助理刑事檢控專員梁育珩、高級檢控官林曉敏、檢控官尹培軒<br/>鄺港傑：大律師Trevor Beel<br/>鄺球：大律師Oliver Davies戴偉奧<br/>鄺港智：大律師Andrew Raffell安華暉<br/>案件編號：HCCC198/2025</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T12:03:51.972731+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":543,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T10:49:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T01:17:13.771919+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T11:57:13.807572+00:00","content_hash":"e7dd60c24cda36437a5773e0f438cf89cefc6209dabc43d93af18cdbda39cda7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}